---
// Hero: one Delegate session in three frames. The desktop workspace (sidebar, chat, workers
// pane), an unfolded foldable (sidebar left, chat right) and the folded cover screen (the chat
// alone). Same session, same workers, same question, so the layouts read as one app.
import Frame from "../Frame.astro";
import Icon from "../Icon.astro";
import ContextRing from "../ContextRing.astro";

const prompt = "Add retry with backoff to the upload client. Keep its public API as it is.";
const workers = [
  { kind: "Planning", model: "Fable 5.1", state: "done · 3m", pct: 34 },
  { kind: "Routine", model: "Opus 5.5 · low", state: "working", pct: 12, live: true, sel: true },
  { kind: "Investigation", model: "glm-5.3", state: "done · 1m", pct: 21 },
];
---
<div class="devices">
  <figure class="dev dev-desk">
    <Frame path="demo-app" class="m-frame" caption="">
      <div class="hd-app">
        <aside class="m-side hd-side">
          <div class="m-side-top">
            <span class="m-btn"><Icon name="plus" size={14} />New Session</span>
          </div>
          <div class="m-side-search"><span class="m-input"><Icon name="search" size={14} />Title, folder, or tag</span></div>

          <div class="m-group-label">Needs you <span class="m-sep">·</span> 1</div>
          <div class="m-row">
            <div class="m-row-main">
              <div class="m-row-title"><span>Upload metrics</span></div>
              <div class="m-row-sum">Asks: count a retry as an error?</div>
              <div class="m-row-meta"><span>2m ago · needs input</span><ContextRing pct={27} /></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="m-group-label">Recent <span class="m-sep">·</span> 3</div>
          <div class="m-row m-row-sel">
            <div class="m-row-main">
              <div class="m-row-title"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>Retry policy</span></div>
              <div class="m-row-sum">Delegating to 3 workers</div>
              <div class="m-row-meta"><span>just now · working</span><ContextRing pct={9} /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="m-row">
            <div class="m-row-main">
              <div class="m-row-title"><span>Flaky upload test</span><span class="chip chip-static">TUI</span></div>
              <div class="m-row-sum">Open in a terminal; watching live</div>
              <div class="m-row-meta"><span>8m ago · in progress</span><ContextRing pct={58} /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="m-row">
            <div class="m-row-main">
              <div class="m-row-title"><span>README badges</span></div>
              <div class="m-row-sum">Badges point at the new CI</div>
              <div class="m-row-meta"><span>1h ago · done</span><ContextRing pct={15} /></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="m-side-foot"><Icon name="worker" size={14} />3 agents · 2 sessions</div>
        </aside>

        <section class="m-main">
          <header class="m-head">
            <span class="m-head-title">Retry policy</span>
            <span class="m-head-sub m-mono">feat/retry-backoff</span>
            <span class="m-head-end"><span class="hd-mode">delegate <span class="m-sep">·</span> align</span></span>
          </header>
          <div class="m-thread hd-thread">
            <div class="m-msg-user">{prompt}</div>
            <p class="m-msg">We agreed the plan: retry inside <code>send()</code>, cap it at 5 tries, never retry a 4xx. I'll hand the change to a routine worker and check the server side in parallel.</p>
            <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><Icon name="chevron-right" size={12} /><span class="m-tool-name">agent_spawn</span><span class="m-tool-arg">routine · Opus 5.5 · feat/retry-backoff</span><span class="m-ok">✓</span></div></div>
            <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><Icon name="chevron-right" size={12} /><span class="m-tool-name">agent_spawn</span><span class="m-tool-arg">investigation · glm-5.3</span><span class="m-ok">✓</span></div></div>
            <p class="m-msg">The server dedupes by upload id, so a retried <code>finalize()</code> is safe.</p>
            <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><span class="live-dot"></span><span class="m-tool-name">agent_wait</span><span class="m-tool-arg">routine</span><span class="m-muted">40s</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="m-composer">
            <div class="m-composer-row">
              <span class="m-input">Steer, or queue a message</span>
              <span class="m-btn m-btn-primary m-btn-off"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={14} />Steer</span>
            </div>
            <div class="m-composer-foot"><span class="m-mono">Opus 5.5 · medium</span><span class="m-end m-mono">88k · 9%</span><ContextRing pct={9} /></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="hd-workers">
          <div class="m-group-label">Workers <span class="m-sep">·</span> 3</div>
          {workers.map((w) => (
            <div class:list={["m-wrow", w.sel && "m-wrow-sel"]}>
              <Icon name="worker" size={14} />
              <div class="m-row-main">
                <div class="m-row-title">{w.live && <span class="live-dot" />}<span>{w.kind}</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span class="m-mono">{w.model}</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span>{w.state}</span><ContextRing pct={w.pct} /><span>{w.pct}%</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          ))}
          <div class="hd-wt">
            <div class="m-wt"><Icon name="branch" size={13} /><span>feat/retry-backoff</span><span class="chip chip-info"><span class="chip-dot"></span>Active</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="hd-peek">
            <div class="hd-peek-head"><span class="live-dot"></span>Routine <span class="m-muted m-mono">transcript</span></div>
            <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><Icon name="chevron-right" size={12} /><span class="m-tool-name">edit</span><span class="m-tool-arg">client.ts</span><span class="m-tool-stat"><span class="m-add">+18</span><span class="m-del">−4</span></span></div></div>
            <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><span class="live-dot"></span><span class="m-tool-name">bash</span><span class="m-tool-arg">pnpm test upload</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </Frame>
    <figcaption class="dev-label">On your desk</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="dev dev-fold">
    <div class="fold" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="fold-screen">
        <div class="phone-status"><span>9:41</span><span>84%</span></div>
        <div class="fold-app">
          <aside class="fold-side">
            <div class="m-group-label">Needs you <span class="m-sep">·</span> 1</div>
            <div class="m-row">
              <div class="m-row-main">
                <div class="m-row-title"><span>Upload metrics</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span>needs input</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="m-group-label">Recent <span class="m-sep">·</span> 3</div>
            <div class="m-row m-row-sel">
              <div class="m-row-main">
                <div class="m-row-title"><span class="live-dot"></span><span>Retry policy</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span>working</span><ContextRing pct={9} /></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="m-row">
              <div class="m-row-main">
                <div class="m-row-title"><span>Flaky upload test</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span>in progress</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="m-row">
              <div class="m-row-main">
                <div class="m-row-title"><span>README badges</span></div>
                <div class="m-row-meta"><span>done</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
          <section class="fold-main">
            <header class="m-head"><span class="m-head-title">Retry policy</span><span class="m-head-end"><span class="hd-mode"><Icon name="worker" size={12} />3</span></span></header>
            <div class="m-thread">
              <p class="m-msg">I'll hand the change to a routine worker and check the server side in parallel.</p>
              <div class="hd-wcard">
                {workers.map((w) => (
                  <div class="hd-wline">{w.live ? <span class="live-dot" /> : <span class="m-ok">✓</span>}<span>{w.kind}</span><span class="m-mono m-muted">{w.model.split(" · ")[0]}</span></div>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div class="m-tool"><div class="m-tool-sum"><span class="live-dot"></span><span class="m-tool-name">agent_wait</span><span class="m-tool-arg">routine</span></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="m-composer">
              <div class="m-composer-row"><span class="m-input">Steer, or queue</span><span class="m-btn m-btn-primary m-btn-off m-btn-icon"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={14} /></span></div>
            </div>
          </section>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="dev-label">Unfolded</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <figure class="dev dev-phone">
    <div class="phone hd-phone" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="phone-screen">
        <div class="phone-status"><span>9:41</span><span>84%</span></div>
        <header class="m-head"><span class="m-head-title">Retry policy</span><span class="m-head-end"><span class="hd-mode"><Icon name="worker" size={12} />3</span></span></header>
        <div class="m-thread">
          <div class="m-msg-user">Add retry with backoff to the upload client.</div>
          <div class="hd-wcard">
            {workers.map((w) => (
              <div class="hd-wline">{w.live ? <span class="live-dot" /> : <span class="m-ok">✓</span>}<span>{w.kind}</span></div>
            ))}
          </div>
          <p class="m-msg">The server dedupes by upload id, so a retried <code>finalize()</code> is safe.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="m-composer">
          <div class="m-composer-row"><span class="m-input">Steer, or queue</span><span class="m-btn m-btn-primary m-btn-off m-btn-icon"><Icon name="arrow-right" size={14} /></span></div>
          <div class="m-composer-foot"><span class="m-mono">Opus 5.5</span><span class="m-end"><ContextRing pct={9} /></span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figcaption class="dev-label">Folded</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <p class="visually-hidden">One session, Retry policy, shown 3 ways. On a desktop: the sessions sidebar with 1 session that needs you, the chat in Delegate mode handing work to 3 workers on different models, and the workers pane with each worker's model, state and context, its worktree, and the running worker's transcript. On an unfolded foldable: the sidebar on the left and the chat on the right. On a folded phone: the chat alone, with the 3 workers listed inline.</p>
</div>
